        "TileImage": "$($repository e25c7c8b-88c0-4ab5-adeb-3583fadf4e6d).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rProvidence operatives Chen Ting and Merrill Krantz are a lethal team of assassins. \r\rChen is a disciplined wetworker assigned to guard a high-profile target, always composed, always watching. \r\rMerrill is a field operative skilled in surveillance, misdirection, and clean kills from the shadows. \r\rThey believe that you are in town on a contract, triggering a coordinated response. Their bond makes them confident but also predictable.\r\rIsolate and eliminate.\r\rGood Luck, 47",
